menuconfig ZMK_FEATURE_BRAILLE
    bool "Braille module hello-world stub"
    default n
    depends on !ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
      Build the Braille module's startup log message. No Braille input,
      translation, or HID output is implemented yet.
